  {
    "id": "backup",
    "zh": {
      "lines": [
        "备份任务说明",
        "每晚 02:00 执行全量备份；若 40 分钟内未完成则判定超时，任务会被中止并在次日重试。超时不计为错误，但连续三次超时会触发警告邮件。",
        "- 全量备份平均耗时 31 分钟，最长一次 39 分 50 秒。",
        "- 增量备份平均 48 秒。",
        "备份文件保留 30 天，之后自动删除。"
      ],
      "marks": [
        {
          "l": 2,
          "q": "39 分 50 秒",
          "voices": {
            "sharp": {
              "t": "离超时就差十秒，刺激",
              "e": "😬"
            },
            "gentle": {
              "t": "再紧一点点就到终点",
              "e": "😬"
            },
            "chuuni": {
              "t": "结界只剩十秒",
              "e": "😬"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "l": 1,
          "q": "次日重试",
          "voices": {
            "sharp": {
              "t": "今晚不行就明晚，佛系",
              "e": "🧘"
            },
            "gentle": {
              "t": "今晚先歇歇也好",
              "e": "🧘"
            },
            "chuuni": {
              "t": "明夜再启时之门",
              "e": "🧘"
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    "en": {
      "lines": [
        "Backup job overview",
        "A full backup runs nightly at 02:00. If it does not finish within 40 minutes it is marked as timed out, aborted and retried the next night. A timeout is not counted as an error, but three timeouts in a row send a warning email.",
        "- Full backup: 31 min on average, 39 min 50 s at worst.",
        "- Incremental backup: 48 s on average.",
        "Backups are kept for 30 days and then deleted automatically."
      ],
      "marks": [
        {
          "l": 2,
          "q": "39 min 50 s",
          "voices": {
            "sharp": {
              "t": "Ten seconds from a timeout. Thrilling.",
              "e": "😬"
            },
            "gentle": {
              "t": "A close finish, little backup.",
              "e": "😬"
            },
            "chuuni": {
              "t": "The clock gate nearly closed!",
              "e": "😬"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "l": 1,
          "q": "retried the next night",
          "voices": {
            "sharp": {
              "t": "Tomorrow is also a day, apparently.",
              "e": "🧘"
            },
            "gentle": {
              "t": "Rest now, try again tomorrow.",
              "e": "🧘"
            },
            "chuuni": {
              "t": "Nightfall resets the quest.",
              "e": "🧘"
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  },
